        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Scope1: 4 Mark is alot, but its on Scope\nScope 2: Endless mark, an upgrade, and stackable, but only works on Selena's own attacks\nScope 3: Increases Mark damage, dupes only stack duration, not damage increase\nScope 4: Works on Allies Attack cards, dupes extend the buff duration, very good with draw divine\nScope 5: Thins the deck, but no Mark on use, and only 1 AOE Mark per turn, kinda weak"
