            "en": "Drone 1: Passion Weaknes usually irrelevant\nDrone 2: 2 AOE Mark, on an attack is very good\nDrone 3: Ramping damage but is a finisher, so if unlucky it can kill a combo turn when drawn\nDrone 4: 1 Turn buff, triggers even if allies attack, opportunistically very good\nDrone 5: Better drone 3, thins your deck and is always a guranteed damage source\nAll versions should include ally attacks (lmk if I'm wrong)"
