        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Tactical 1: Huge ammount of Tenacity Damage, also Doesn't care for Elemental Weakness\nTactical 2: Damage and 2.5 Tenacity Damage vs Passion Weak, not bad\nTactical 1 vs 2 just means if you're against Passion Weak or not\nTactical 3: Worse Tactical 70% of the time, not recommended\nTactical 4: Retain to thin deck or also Lets you recharge tenacity for more AP/Ravage effects\nTactical 5: AOE 1 Mark, but the AOE 1 Tenacity damage currently isn't that great\nDraw Neutral is very good here"
